## Human intervention needed

The automated job failed during post-repair test generation for `io.netty:netty-codec-socks:4.2.1.Final`.

Preserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9340-fails-native-image-run-io.netty-netty-codec-socks-4.2.1.Final-4a9c9c0e

